# 统一行尾：仓库与工作区均使用 LF，避免 Windows autocrlf 导致的假改动
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件禁止任何转换
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Preserve the upstream bytes used by vendor/backports.json on every platform.
vendor/** -text
